                <pb facs="0526" n="514" sameAs="frus:frus1945v08/pg514"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">891.00/12–2745: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Ambassador in Iran</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Murray</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of State </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Tehran</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1945-12-27T08:00:00+03:25">December 27,
                            1945—8 a.m.</date>
                        <lb/> [Received December 29—2:29 a.m.]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>1185. Both Prime and Foreign Ministers have asked my opinion of their making
                    direct personal appeal to Stalin in effort to solve present crises. Their
                    approach was informal and off the record <pb facs="0527" n="515" xml:id="pg515"
                    /> and I replied in same manner to the effect that it was my personal opinion
                    that contacts between men often succeed where note writing between governments
                    fails. I added that since note writing in the present crisis had brought no
                    results, such a personal appeal could do no harm and in any event would add to
                    Iranian case by having it on record. They appeared to be in agreement and it is
                    probable that some sort of personal appeal will be forthcoming. Foreign Minister
                    informed me he would also ask opinion of British Embassy.</p>
                <p>Repeated Moscow 368, London 148.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Murray</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
